@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-52 - Notify User Return Status

actor "System" as Actor
boundary "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB
participant "Gmail SMTP" as Gmail

Actor -> Service: Domain status changed
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service -> Gmail: Send notification email when configured
Gmail --> Service: Delivery accepted or warning logged
Service --> Actor: Notification flow completed

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Return status thay đổi
Post: Email được gửi cho user
Main flow:
1. Khi return status thay đổi
2. System xác định template (approved, rejected, processing, completed)
3. System gửi email qua Nodemailer
end note
@enduml
